{"title":"Dark Wizards","slug":"Dark_Wizards","pageid":1091,"revid":14659,"timestamp":"2024-09-11T05:12:49Z","lastEditor":"Shadow1100","categories":["Vinyls"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Shop","value":"The Oak Depot"},{"label":"Price","value":"$600"},{"label":"Function","value":"Plays music"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.16.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"07/03/2023"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"song","text":"Song"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\n<p><br>\n<b>Dark Wizards</b> is a Vinyl by Kevin Macleod which plays epic choir music.\n</p><p>It is located ontop of one of the air vents inside <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Depot secret\">Depot secret</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"song\">Song</h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: media file\">media file</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>The title of the actual song is Final Battle of the Dark Wizards.</li>\n<li>Before the map revamp It used to be located in a hidden room in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>.</li></ul>\n\n</div>"}
